{"about_the_game":"Gladiators! Welcome to the bloody arena, where paper beats rock, rock beats scissors and shotgun beats everything else!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/801750/extras/1a5afd9f76e3626206b7c82cda21d83d.avif?t=1727940601\" width=616 height=616 /></span><br><br><strong>Hot Shot Burn</strong> is a top-down, hilariously violent party brawler where space gladiators compete in the galaxy's ultimate televised blood sport. Grab some popcorn, invite up to 4 friends, and experience crazy couch battles full of ridiculous flukes and insane skill shots.<br><br>Can't invite friends to come over? No problem! Just set up a game night and seamlessly play online.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/801750/extras/7da8bdc231c20918866c3b26f11fc3c5.poster.avif?t=1727940601\" width=616 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/801750/extras/7da8bdc231c20918866c3b26f11fc3c5.webm?t=1727940601\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/801750/extras/7da8bdc231c20918866c3b26f11fc3c5.mp4?t=1727940601\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Pick your hero, from an ass-whooping space wrestler to deadly moth assassin and one very confused fluffy alien. Each character has unique skills and playstyles, so find your match and get ready to explode your friends and loved ones for a galactic audience of screaming fans.<br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/801750/extras/b8b06e7d81b8416f15ca81092bc26a71.avif?t=1727940601\" width=616 height=184 /></span><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Fast-paced, unpredictable multiplayer action for 2-4 players<br></li><li>Play on the couch, online, or both!<br></li><li>Loads of arenas, each with unique hazards and rules<br></li><li>Feel the effects of powerful mutators that can warp reality and turn a match on its head.<br></li><li>Vibrant art style inspired by Saturday morning cartoons<br></li><li>Powered the thumping tunes of SYNTHWAVEEEEEEE!</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A spectacular intergalactic show!</h2>It's showtime! Fight and die in front of a live studio audience as you take part in the ultimate gladiator battles. The audience cheers! The commentator makes fun of your tights! A good time is had by all! (All the survivors, I mean\u2026)<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/801750/extras/ac7f2afa08a4518a30fdd7153d714283.poster.avif?t=1727940601\" width=616 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/801750/extras/ac7f2afa08a4518a30fdd7153d714283.webm?t=1727940601\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/801750/extras/ac7f2afa08a4518a30fdd7153d714283.mp4?t=1727940601\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Win at all costs!</h2>We all know that you're here to win, so why bother with &quot;fair play&quot; or &quot;the laws of physics&quot;? Teleport, become invisible, bounce bullets off walls, shoot bullets through walls - whatever it takes to make sure you're the last one standing. All's fair in love and space gladiator arena combat.<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/801750/extras/56abc58992269cb5018807c61e52f947.poster.avif?t=1727940601\" width=616 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/801750/extras/56abc58992269cb5018807c61e52f947.webm?t=1727940601\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/801750/extras/56abc58992269cb5018807c61e52f947.mp4?t=1727940601\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"icon":"f8b97b573398d6d415c5059c4734710bf8c33f05.jpg","localized_name":"Freshman","name":"Freshman","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/801750/f8b97b573398d6d415c5059c4734710bf8c33f05.jpg"},{"icon":"a4150e02c85aef25ec29988d9beaa80352f6ac3a.jpg","localized_name":"Seasoned Fighter","name":"Seasoned Fighter","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/801750/a4150e02c85aef25ec29988d9beaa80352f6ac3a.jpg"},{"icon":"31b5db24d883a93b9605f7eb662378685c3329a1.jpg","localized_name":"Gladiator","name":"Gladiator","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/801750/31b5db24d883a93b9605f7eb662378685c3329a1.jpg"},{"icon":"eef063537618a253f59a3d277c7305e6ea8e559e.jpg","localized_name":"A little bit of magic","name":"A little bit of magic","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/801750/eef063537618a253f59a3d277c7305e6ea8e559e.jpg"},{"icon":"225e65b73387b8b5cd491ef9744d249a19e40240.jpg","localized_name":"Sniper","name":"Sniper","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/801750/225e65b73387b8b5cd491ef9744d249a19e40240.jpg"},{"icon":"ec9f702ac7be9d6a66cf53ccc04ac6d530598cbb.jpg","localized_name":"Rabbit's foot","name":"Rabbit's foot","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/801750/ec9f702ac7be9d6a66cf53ccc04ac6d530598cbb.jpg"},{"icon":"14176d64a0086b8a0770efbff3ca73b5b0b036c2.jpg","localized_name":"Style Wizard","name":"Style Wizard","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/801750/14176d64a0086b8a0770efbff3ca73b5b0b036c2.jpg"},{"icon":"2b485e4f2b9441175049a5186041b3b73e03d0b6.jpg","localized_name":"Spoiled pancake","name":"Spoiled pancake","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/801750/2b485e4f2b9441175049a5186041b3b73e03d0b6.jpg"},{"icon":"765439dbd057530ca99b44567f44dad8351241ba.jpg","localized_name":"Space Gladiator","name":"Space Gladiator","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/801750/765439dbd057530ca99b44567f44dad8351241ba.jpg"},{"icon":"d53e9d467794b699a43caa580da9e9716f81e11e.jpg","localized_name":"Burn!","name":"Burn!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/801750/d53e9d467794b699a43caa580da9e9716f81e11e.jpg"}],"total":35},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/801750?t=1727940601","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/801750/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1727940601","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/801750/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1727940601","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/801750/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1727940601","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen PvP","id":37},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h1>ADD OUR GAME ON YOUR WISHLIST AND FOLLOW US!</h1><p><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/801750/extras/3325f2549ed56659c8d9f78b8bb53378.avif?t=1727940601\" width=612 height=80 /></span></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1>Gladiators! Welcome to the bloody arena, where paper beats rock, rock beats scissors and shotgun beats everything else!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/801750/extras/1a5afd9f76e3626206b7c82cda21d83d.avif?t=1727940601\" width=616 height=616 /></span><br><br><strong>Hot Shot Burn</strong> is a top-down, hilariously violent party brawler where space gladiators compete in the galaxy's ultimate televised blood sport. Grab some popcorn, invite up to 4 friends, and experience crazy couch battles full of ridiculous flukes and insane skill shots.<br><br>Can't invite friends to come over? No problem! Just set up a game night and seamlessly play online.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/801750/extras/7da8bdc231c20918866c3b26f11fc3c5.poster.avif?t=1727940601\" width=616 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/801750/extras/7da8bdc231c20918866c3b26f11fc3c5.webm?t=1727940601\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/801750/extras/7da8bdc231c20918866c3b26f11fc3c5.mp4?t=1727940601\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Pick your hero, from an ass-whooping space wrestler to deadly moth assassin and one very confused fluffy alien. Each character has unique skills and playstyles, so find your match and get ready to explode your friends and loved ones for a galactic audience of screaming fans.<br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/801750/extras/b8b06e7d81b8416f15ca81092bc26a71.avif?t=1727940601\" width=616 height=184 /></span><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Fast-paced, unpredictable multiplayer action for 2-4 players<br></li><li>Play on the couch, online, or both!<br></li><li>Loads of arenas, each with unique hazards and rules<br></li><li>Feel the effects of powerful mutators that can warp reality and turn a match on its head.<br></li><li>Vibrant art style inspired by Saturday morning cartoons<br></li><li>Powered the thumping tunes of SYNTHWAVEEEEEEE!</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A spectacular intergalactic show!</h2>It's showtime! Fight and die in front of a live studio audience as you take part in the ultimate gladiator battles. The audience cheers! The commentator makes fun of your tights! A good time is had by all! (All the survivors, I mean\u2026)<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/801750/extras/ac7f2afa08a4518a30fdd7153d714283.poster.avif?t=1727940601\" width=616 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/801750/extras/ac7f2afa08a4518a30fdd7153d714283.webm?t=1727940601\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/801750/extras/ac7f2afa08a4518a30fdd7153d714283.mp4?t=1727940601\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Win at all costs!</h2>We all know that you're here to win, so why bother with &quot;fair play&quot; or &quot;the laws of physics&quot;? Teleport, become invisible, bounce bullets off walls, shoot bullets through walls - whatever it takes to make sure you're the last one standing. All's fair in love and space gladiator arena combat.<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/801750/extras/56abc58992269cb5018807c61e52f947.poster.avif?t=1727940601\" width=616 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/801750/extras/56abc58992269cb5018807c61e52f947.webm?t=1